**Version**: 0.2
**Created**: 2026-07-30
**Updated**: 2026-07-30 — [DD-CIC-THEME] ratified (David): widget renamed in prose/params `cic_widget` -> `colonial_console` (node ids + doc tag [SPEC:CXC-CIC] UNCHANGED); theming is a semantic `theme` binding ({cic default, sickbay, flight_deck, raptor, …} resolving to a base/highlight palette); namespace scope root generalized `cic/<station>/*` -> `colonial_console/<station>/*`; station ids are dotted semantic paths (`location.instance.role`).
**Status**: Draft — foundational fleet-wide colonial-console shell (`colonial_console`, CIC being its default theme) for the BSG CIC sim program. Four judgment calls remain DRAFTED + FLAGGED for the architect to ratify: the duty-station identity/pairing scheme ([DD-CIC-STATION-IDENTITY]), the SVG-map two-kind tag/infer contract ([DD-CIC-SVG-KIND]), the 2-up portrait layout mechanism ([DD-CIC-TWO-UP]), and the embedded-tier stance ([DD-CIC-TIER]). The fleet-wide theming + widget-naming generalization ([DD-CIC-THEME]) is RATIFIED + actioned. Open sub-item for David: the sickbay / flight_deck / raptor theme palettes are named-but-TBD.
